eline (pre-benchmark) shape. BE-002 asks an agent to reject orders\n * whose amount is not positive; the baseline deliberately accepts any amount.\n */\ndata class Order(\n    val orderId: String,\n    val customerId: String,\n    val amount: BigDecimal,\n    val currency: String,\n    val quantity: Int = 1,\n    val fulfilment: Fulfilment = Fulfilment(0, 0, FulfilmentStatus.UNALLOCATED),\n)\n\ndata class CreateOrderRequest(\n    val orderId: String,\n    val customerId: String,\n    val amount: BigDecimal,\n    val currency: String,\n    val quantity: Int? = null,\n)\n","numLines":40,"startLine":1,"totalLines":40}}}
